<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Başkan</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Kadir ÖZKAYA</span></p>
</div>
</td>
<td style="width: 33.333333333333336%; padding: 1pt 6pt; border: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="line-height: 1.05;">
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Başkanvekili</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Hasan Tahsin GÖKCAN</span></p>
</div>
</td>
<td style="width: 33.333333333333336%; padding: 1pt 6pt; border: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">
